OL,3,GNEWSAWhy saunas are becoming the new
OL,4,Adating hotspot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rapidly growing sauna culture in
OL,7,Fthe UK is not only offering a space to
OL,8,Fsweat and relax, but is also becoming a
OL,9,Fdating hotspot.
OL,11,FSauna owners across the West of England
OL,12,Fhave said dating in saunas is on the
OL,13,Frise - as some head to the heated rooms
OL,14,Ffor first dates, while strangers spark
OL,15,Frelationships too.
OL,17,FJake Rocking, who runs a new sauna at
OL,18,FWeston Marine Lake in North Somerset,
OL,19,Fsaid that "sauna is the new pub".
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
