OL,3,GNEWSAWhy saunas are becoming the new
OL,4,Adating hotspot
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther sauna owners are considering
OL,7,Fspeed dating events and say the
OL,8,Fintimate space helps people connect and
OL,9,Fopen up away from the distractions of
OL,10,Fphones and alcohol.
